{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"# Outstanding dependency advisory on `main`\n\nThe scheduled dependency-advisory lane found CRITICAL/HIGH advisories against the committed lock. Per bug `63e8`, this does NOT block merges or Gerrit submit for changes that leave the dependency map alone — it blocks **releases**, and it is owned here rather than by whoever happens to have a change in flight.\n\n- **Advisories:** CVE-2026-84379,CVE-2026-84380,CVE-2026-84382\n- **Detail:** CVE-2026-84379 (httpx2 2.10.0, HIGH); CVE-2026-84380 (httpx2 2.10.0, HIGH); CVE-2026-84382 (httpx2 2.10.0, HIGH)\n- **Detected at:** 2026-09-09T03:36:36Z\n- **Run:** https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/34307568070\n\n## Remediation\n\nFollow `docs/dependency-advisory-runbook.md`: upgrade the direct dependency first; if an upstream cap blocks that, `override-dependencies` with a recorded justification; then track the upstream fix so the override can be removed. `constraint-dependencies` cannot express this — it only NARROWS, and returns UNSATISFIABLE as its expected output.\n\nThis ticket auto-closes when the advisory clears.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The locked environment no longer reports CVE-2026-84379, CVE-2026-84380, or CVE-2026-84382 against `httpx2`.\n- [ ] The dependency resolver either upgrades `httpx2` to a fixed release (2.12.0 or newer) or records a justified temporary override if an upstream cap makes that impossible.\n- [ ] Dependency-map changes are limited to the advisory remediation and keep the existing agents/provider dependency seams working.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run `uv lock --check` after the lock update.\n- Run `uv sync --locked --extra dev` so the local environment matches the committed lock.\n- Run `pip-audit --format json --progress-spinner off` (or `python scripts/dependency_audit.py gate --lane dependency-map --no-enrich`) and confirm the cited CVEs are absent.\n- Run `GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_SYSTEM=/dev/null make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=2` before push, dropping to `PYTEST_WORKERS=1` only if the run dies for low memory.\n"}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788984749642993001,"uuid":"f61d9a03-42c0-4d12-90e6-0da6753e4577"}